  "content": "[Intro]\n[Ebmaj7]\n[Bb/D]\n[Cm]\n[C/D][D7(b5)]Baka\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Gm]mitai, kodomo\n[Dm7]na no ne Yume\n[Cm]wo, [F]otte kidzut-\n[Bb]suite [Dm7]Uso\n[Cm]ga, [F7]heta na\n[Dm7]kuse [Gm]ni Wara-\n[Cm]enai [F]egao\n[Gm]miseta\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Eb]I love you mo, roku\n[Dm]ni iwanai\n[Cm]Kuchibeta de [D]honma ni\n[Gm]bukiyou\n[Ebmaj7]Na no ni, [F7/Eb]na no ni\n[G7/D][Dm7]doushite Sayo-\n[Cm]nara wa, ieta\n[Dsus4]no [D]Dame da ne.\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cmaj7]Dame [D7/C]yo, dame\n[Bm]na no yo [Em]Anta ga,\n[F#(b5)]suki [B7]de, suki-\n[Em7]sugite [G]Dore dake,\n[C][C#dim]tsuyoi osa-\n[Bm]ke [Em7]demo Yuga-\n[Am]manai, Omo-\n[C/D]ide ga, Baka mitai..\n[G]\n\n[Re-Intro]\n[Ebmaj7]\n[Bb/D]\n[Cm]\n[C/D][D7(b5)]Baka\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Gm]mitai, hontou\n[Dm7]baka ne An-\n[Cm]ta, [F]shinjiru ba-\n[Bb]kari de [Dm7]Tsuyo-\n[Cm]i, [F7]onna\n[Dm7]no [Gm]furi Setsu-\n[Cm]nasa no, [F]yokaze\n[Gm]abiru\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Eb]Hitori ni natte, san-\n[Dm]nen ga sugi\n[Cm]Machinami sae [D]mo, kawa-\n[Gm]rimashita\n[Ebmaj7]Na no ni, [F7/Eb]na no ni\n[G7/D][Dm7]doushite Mire-\n[Cm]n dake, okiza-\n[Dsus4]ri [D]Honma ni.\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cmaj7]Roku [D7/C]na, oto-\n[Bm]ko ya nai [Em]Soroi no,\n[B7][F#(b5)]yubiwa hazu-\n[Em7]shimasu [G]Zama miro,\n[C][C#dim]seisei-\n[Bm]suru [Em7]wa Ii\n[Am]kagen, Mat-\n[C/D]tete mo, Baka mitai..\n\n[Bridge]\n[Em7]  [B/D#]\n[G]  [C#dim]\n[Cmaj9]  [Gadd9/B]\n[Ebmaj7]  [Bb]\n[Am7]  [Gadd9/B]  [C#dim]  [Ebmaj7]\n[Ab]  [Dsus4]\nDame da ne.\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cmaj7]Dame [D7/C]yo, dame\n[Bm]na no yo [Em]Anta ga,\n[F#(b5)]suki [B7]de, suki-\n[Em7]sugite [G]Dore dake,\n[C][C#dim]tsuyoi osa-\n[Bm]ke [Em7]demo Yuga-\n[Am]manai, Omo-\n[C/D]ide ga, Baka mitai..\n[C#dim][G]Honma ni.\n[Cmaj7]Roku [D7/C]na, oto-\n[Bm]ko ya nai [Em]Soroi no,\n[B7][F#(b5)]yubiwa hazu-\n[Em7]shimasu [G]Zama miro,\n[C][C#dim]seisei-\n[Bm]suru [Em7]wa Nan\n[Am]na na yo, kono\n[C/D]namida, Baka mitai..\n[G]\n\n[Outro]\n[Ebmaj7]\n[Bb/D]\n[Cm]\n[C/D]  [D7(b5)]\n[G]",
